  "title": "Hyundai Motor India's Connected-vehicle Expansion",
  "summary": "Hyundai Motor India expects connected-vehicle penetration to rise as customers seek greater safety and convenience, with sales targeted to cross 2 million by 2030. The company aims to achieve 10 lakh connected cars by 2027, leveraging its proprietary AI-powered technology platform.",
